{
  "id": "thorn_bel_talk",
  "start": "greet",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "greet",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "A yard of reed in every stage between cut and roofed, and a man sorting it by feel."
        },
        {
          "text": "“Roofing, thatching, or reed. If it is reed, Maud's your woman.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "thorn_bel_cut",
          "text": "You judge cut surfaces for a living. What cuts a cypress knee off level?",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "lore": [
                "thorn_knees_cut"
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "insight",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                12,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_ferrymen",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "thorn_bel_cut_told",
            "onFailure": "thorn_bel_cut_wont"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "thorn_bel_hand",
          "text": "Have you ever seen the toll ledger?",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "lore": [
                "thorn_toll_hand"
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "insight",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                13,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_ferrymen",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "thorn_bel_hand_told",
            "onFailure": "thorn_bel_hand_wont"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "greet_leave",
          "text": "Nothing.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "thorn_bel_cut_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“Nothing I sell.” He is definite. “Bill will do it if it is Maud's bill and Maud is swinging it. Anything else crushes before it cuts.” He turns a reed over. “There are a hundred of them out there cut clean and healed. Somebody had a very good edge and forty years ago.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "thorn_knees_cut"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "thorn_bel_cut_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "thorn_bel_cut_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_ferrymen",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "thorn_bel_cut_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "thorn_bel_hand_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“Sarl has it. I have signed the book next to it for twenty years.” He straightens up. “Same hand the whole way back. Not a copied hand — I copy hands, it is half of thatching a name into a ridge. That is one hand with a broken g and it goes back two hundred years.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "thorn_toll_hand"
          }
        }
      ],
